   "run": "handcheck-2026-10-23",
   "note": "after fix (tp-379/4, u11): Donna Leon led a week-long literature seminar every summer in the remote Valais mountain village of Ernen (Festival Musikdorf Ernen) from about 2003 — Diogenes (2018: 'wie jedes Jahr'; 2019 edition with Judith Flanders), Literarischer Monat (Dec 2012: 'jährlich ausgebuchtes Schreibseminar', 'seit neun Jahren') and the festival's Wikipedia article agree. Nothing links Marklund or Walters to such a seminar. The printed wording w12994 (not w12831 — that id doesn't exist; the brief's id was a slip) was f12831's only wording and it had no generated wording, so per the brief f12831 was corrected in place: it now asks the card's question. That means the Pålmark question is no longer a fact, though Pålmark is still in the body. The new-fact ids weren't needed. The 2027 festival programme lists no Leon seminar, so the wording and body use the past tense."
